kies that are not essential.":[""],"Privacy & consent":[""],"Tell us who you email, and Groundhogg will turn on the consent settings that the law asks for. You can fine-tune them in the settings later.":[""],"Your policies":[""],"Linked from your forms and the preferences center.":[""],"Privacy policy":[""],"Terms & conditions":[""],"Your license is active!":[""],"Your license is active":[""],"Your premium features are unlocked. Install your add-ons any time from the Extensions page.":[""],"Do you have a license?":[""],"A license unlocks premium add-ons and integrations, and lets you receive replies from your contacts in Groundhogg.":[""],"License key":[""],"Paste your license key":[""],"Where do I find my license key?":[""],"No license? Groundhogg works without one, and you can add one any time.":[""],"Compare plans":[""],"Skip for now":[""],"Loading\u2026":[""],"Replies are on":[""],"When a contact replies to an email you sent from Groundhogg, the reply shows up on their contact record, where you can answer it.":[""],"Get replies in Groundhogg":[""],"When a contact replies to an email you sent from Groundhogg, the reply lands on their contact record. You and your team can read it and answer it without leaving WordPress.":[""],"Your site is not on HTTPS, so replies can't be delivered to it yet. You can turn this on later in the email settings.":[""],"I agree to the %s, and I understand that email sent to my inbox address is received by Groundhogg\u2019s Messages service and passed on to my site.":[""],"Turn on replies":[""],"Checking that your site can receive replies. This can take up to a minute\u2026":[""],"Your site gets a private address that replies are delivered to. Nothing to install.":[""],"Not now":[""],"Share how I use Groundhogg":[""],"Once a week, send Groundhogg Inc. the number of active flows, new contacts and broadcasts, which add-ons are installed, and the versions of Groundhogg, WordPress and PHP, along with your email address. Never your contacts or what's in your emails.":[""],"Get 15% off your first year of a premium plan.":[""],"Email me about new features":[""],"News, tips and the occasional offer, sent to %s. Unsubscribe any time.":[""],"Stay in the loop":[""],"Help us make Groundhogg better, and hear about what's new. Both are optional, and you can change your mind later.":[""],"Add your users as contacts":[""],"%s user on your site is not a contact yet.":[""],"Syncing in the background":[""],"Sync users":[""],"Import your contacts":[""],"Bring in your list from a CSV file.":[""],"Build your first flow":[""],"Welcome new subscribers with emails that send automatically.":[""],"Get started with AI":[""],"Connect Claude or another AI assistant, and have it build flows, write emails and find contacts for you.":[""],"Connect an AI assistant":[""],"Invite your team":[""],"Give your staff their own login, with the access they need.":[""],"You're all set, %s!":[""],"Pick where you'd like to start. You'll find these on your dashboard too.":[""],"Thanks for helping out! Use code <b>IFOUND15OFF<\/b> for 15% off your first year.":[""],"See plans":[""],"Go to the dashboard":[""],"Invite sent to %s":[""],"%s's role was changed":[""],"Each person gets their own login. We'll email them a link to set their password.":[""],"Email address":[""],"Invite":[""],"People already on your site":[""]}}}